WEBVTT

00:07:28.371 --> 00:07:33.704
and empower them to move beyond their circumstances.

00:07:33.704 --> 00:07:36.420
Because it's time that kids like me

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:41.142
stop being the exception, and we become the norm.

00:07:41.142 --> 00:07:42.451
Thank you.

00:07:42.451 --> 00:07:46.790
(Applause)